(text "POWER: USB 5 V -> XC6206 -> 3.3 V\nVDD and VDDH tied: normal-voltage mode.\nUSB VBUS pin receives USB 5 V." (at 20.32 88.9 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left top)) (uuid 5878122a-792d-5244-b532-5c8be4b2136e))
(text "USB-C device only; no USB-PD.\nFirst flash via SWD. USB needs firmware.\nCC1 and CC2 each have their own 5.1k Rd." (at 20.32 104.14 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left top)) (uuid ad579149-2d35-59dc-9149-6e17882487b8))
(text "TEST LED: P0.20, active high.\nRESET switch uses module internal pull-up." (at 76.2 132.08 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left top)) (uuid 64a9dbe2-4881-5bed-b21b-556a71cfc859))
(text "J2: 3V3 sense, GND, CLK, DIO, RESET.\nPico GP2 -> CLK; GP3 -> DIO; GP1 -> RESET.\nDo not connect Pico 3V3 when USB-powered.\nJ3: single 1x14 GPIO/power header; see pin labels." (at 20.32 188.0 0) (effects (font (size 0.9 0.9)) (justify left top)) (uuid 4606d229-d114-57c8-ba60-c82689c52762))
(text "J3: 3V3 logic only; no 5V-tolerant GPIO.\nUse the internal LF RC clock; no 32k crystal.\nAll unbroken-out GPIO and reserved pads NC." (at 76.2 164.0 0) (effects (font (size 0.9 0.9)) (justify left top)) (uuid 780b816f-e45a-5bf2-a8fb-bd6fecc1b876))
